{"page":258,"verses":[{"verse_key":"14:19","surah":14,"ayah":19,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَمْ تَرَ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ خَلَقَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ بِٱلْحَقِّ ۚ إِن يَشَأْ يُذْهِبْكُمْ وَيَأْتِ بِخَلْقٍ جَدِيدٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], do you not see that God created the heavens and the earth for a purpose? He could remove all of you and replace you with a new creation if He wished to:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"14:19"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَرَ","en_gloss":"you see","transliteration":"tara","verse_key":"14:19"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"14:19"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"14:19"},{"pos":5,"ar":"خَلَقَ","en_gloss":"created","transliteration":"khalaqa","verse_key":"14:19"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"14:19"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","verse_key":"14:19"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ ۚ","en_gloss":"in truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"14:19"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"14:19"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَشَأْ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yasha","verse_key":"14:19"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُذْهِبْكُمْ","en_gloss":"He can remove you","transliteration":"yudh'hib'kum","verse_key":"14:19"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَيَأْتِ","en_gloss":"and bring","transliteration":"wayati","verse_key":"14:19"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِخَلْقٍۢ","en_gloss":"a creation","transliteration":"bikhalqin","verse_key":"14:19"},{"pos":14,"ar":"جَدِيدٍۢ","en_gloss":"new","transliteration":"jadīdin","verse_key":"14:19"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٩","en_gloss":"(19)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"14:19"}]},{"verse_key":"14:20","surah":14,"ayah":20,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا ذَٰلِكَ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ بِعَزِيزٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"that is not difficult for God.","words":[{"pos":1